  "note": "Design System v2.2 — platform correction: DokTool V1 is one Flutter app (iOS + Android) for doctors, residents and students plus a separate Next.js Admin Web; no user web app (Future Web). Backend-authoritative (NestJS/Postgres/Prisma), Cloudflare R2 behind StorageService, entitlement model with Demo as an access context and Student tier with visible locked items, no-refund subscriptions (Gross → Fees → Net; profit apart), sourced/versioned/tested calculator governance, offline for all real accounts. New sections 26–28, rewritten 01–10, 12, 13, 15, 16, 18, 22; Design Lock v4 (L33–L44). All V1 hi-fi rebuilt on mobile with the V1 nav; admin rebuilt with the V1 console; 9 new cards (ScreenDemo, ScreenLockedStates, ScreenProfileMobile, ScreenSubscriptionMobile, ScreenCalculatorLibraryMobile, ScreenCalculatorStates, ScreenCalculatorAdmin, ScreenSubscriptionsAdmin, ScreenExpenses); deferred and future-web cards labelled Future; ScreenExpensesRefunds and ScreenSettingsLanguage removed. Sections consolidated to stay within 24: former 14 (evidence governance) and 17 (pharma) are appendices of 25, former 21 (motion) is part of 20, former 24 (design QA) is an appendix of 11."
 }
